OL,3,GNEWSA'New bereavement suite is a game
OL,4,Achanger for grieving families'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new bereavement suite has opened at a
OL,7,Fhospital in Coventry to provide a space
OL,8,Ffor families experiencing the
OL,9,Fheartbreak of baby loss.
OL,11,FThe space at the University Hospital
OL,12,Fhas been designed to offer grieving
OL,13,Fmothers, partners and relatives'
OL,14,Fprivacy, comfort and dignity.
OL,16,FThe project has been supported by
OL,17,Ffamilies who have experienced baby loss
OL,18,Fwith many helping to raise funds for
OL,19,Fvarious items, including artwork and
OL,20,Fsofas.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
