OL,3,GNEWSA'New bereavement suite is a game
OL,4,Achanger for grieving families'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCeri Key, who supported the appeal
OL,7,Fafter losing her baby, Rufus, said: "We
OL,8,Fhope they never need to be used. But I
OL,9,Fknow that if families do have to sadly
OL,10,Fsay goodbye to their baby, this is a
OL,11,Fmore appropriate and kinder environment
OL,12,Fin which to make those memories."
